Package: adrceeg
Type: Package
Title: Build and Filter the Knight ADRC Sleep-EEG Cohort Table
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Harshu", "Pande", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "harshupande1@gmail.com"),
    person("Lina", "Kim", role = "aut"),
    person("Nicole S.", "McKay", role = "aut",
           comment = "Original ADRC data-combining pipeline"))
Description: Reproducible pipeline that combines the Knight ADRC imaging,
    genetic, demographic, clinical and cognitive CSV exports into a single
    longitudinal table, folds in brain-age-gap and PACC data, and filters
    the result to participants who had a sleep EEG. No participant data
    ships with the package: point the pipeline at a local folder of the
    (HIPAA-protected) CSVs and it runs end to end. Originally adapted from
    Nicole S. McKay's ADRC loading script.
